  <!-- ─── ROW 1: Crossover + Branch Decline ─── -->
  <div class="chart-grid chart-grid-3" style="margin-bottom:24px;">

    <!-- Chart 1: Crossover dynamics (digital penetration vs branches) - GLOBAL avg -->
    <div class="chart-panel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <div class="panel-insight-id">Insight 01 · Crossover Dynamics</div>
        <div class="panel-title">Digital Payment Rise vs. Branch Network Collapse</div>
        <div class="panel-desc">Global aggregate: avg digital payment penetration (%, left axis) against total branches across all regions (000s, right axis). The scissor crossing underscores structural displacement.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:280px;">
        <canvas id="chart-crossover"></canvas>
      </div>
      <div class="callout-row">
        <div class="callout rose">
          <div class="callout-dot"></div>
          2019–2020: steepest single-year branch closure acceleration driven by pandemic-forced digital shift
        </div>
        <div class="callout teal">
          <div class="callout-dot"></div>
          Digital penetration crossed 55% globally in 2020, while branches fell below 2017 levels
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Chart 2: Branch decline YoY acceleration -->
    <div class="chart-panel">
      <div class="panel-header">
        <div class="panel-insight-id">Insight 02 · Branch Closure Acceleration</div>
        <div class="panel-title">Annual Branch Closures by Region</div>
        <div class="panel-desc">Year-on-year change in branch count (thousands). Negative = closures. 2020 marks the inflection.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="chart-wrap" style="height:280px;">
        <canvas id="chart-branch-yoy"></canvas>
      </div>
